      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "La última vez, Shiva y Parvati por fin se casaron, y vivieron juntos en el monte Kailash.",
          "en": "Last time, Shiva and Parvati were finally married, and made their home on Mount Kailash."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero Shiva salía a menudo, a recorrer el mundo o a meditar.",
          "en": "But Shiva was often away, wandering the world or meditating."
        },
        {
          "es": "Sus seguidores, los ganas, cuidaban la casa. Y todos obedecían solo a Shiva.",
          "en": "His followers, the ganas, guarded the house. And they all obeyed Shiva alone."
        },
        {
          "es": "El Shiva Purana cuenta que las amigas de Parvati le dijeron: \"Necesitas un guardia que sea solo tuyo\".",
          "en": "The Shiva Purana says Parvati's friends told her: \"You need a guard who is yours alone.\""
        }
