      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Un día, Parvati se preparaba para bañarse.",
          "en": "One day, Parvati was getting ready for her bath."
        },
        {
          "es": "El Shiva Purana cuenta que tomó la pasta que se había untado en la piel, y con ella formó a un niño.",
          "en": "The Shiva Purana says she took the paste she had rubbed on her skin, and shaped it into a boy."
        },
        {
          "es": "Le dio vida. Era fuerte, hermoso y valiente.",
          "en": "She gave him life. He was strong, handsome and brave."
        },
        {
          "es": "\"Eres mi hijo\", le dijo. \"Cuida mi puerta y no dejes entrar a nadie\".",
          "en": "\"You are my son,\" she told him. \"Guard my door, and let no one in.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "El niño tomó un bastón y se paró frente a la puerta.",
          "en": "The boy picked up a stick and took his place at the door."
        }
      ],
