      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "El niño se quedó en la puerta con su bastón. Entonces Shiva volvió a casa.",
          "en": "The boy stood guard with his stick. Then Shiva came home."
        },
        {
          "es": "\"¿Quién eres? No puedes pasar\", dijo el niño. No sabía quién era Shiva.",
          "en": "\"Who are you? You cannot go in,\" said the boy. He did not know who Shiva was."
        },
        {
          "es": "Shiva tampoco lo conocía. \"Esta es mi casa\", dijo. \"Hazte a un lado\".",
          "en": "Shiva did not know him either. \"This is my house,\" he said. \"Step aside.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero el niño no se movió. Su madre le había dicho: nadie entra.",
          "en": "But the boy would not move. His mother had said: no one goes in."
        }
      ],
